  "name": "Integer Transfer",
  "description": "This function provides a means for switching integer values. When <S3> equals zero, the output equals <S1>. When <S3> equals one, the output equals <S2>. NOTE: This is different from the analog transfer (function code 9), which has an optional transfer time feature.",
